  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Chop cauliflower (including stalk!) into small florets.\n• Roughly chop carrot into bite-sized chunks. Slice brown onion into wedges. Zest lime to get a pinch and slice into wedges.\n• Place cauliflower, carrot and onion on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/688816311cc5cea712806bdb/step-53f39500.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add the water (for the rice) to a medium saucepan and bring to the boil.\n• Add jasmine rice, stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low.\n• Cook for 10 mins, then remove pan from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/688816311cc5cea712806bdb/step-8f075410.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Once veggies are done, heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat.\n• Cook Japanese curry paste, coconut milk, the water (for the curry) and soy sauce, stirring, until slightly reduced, 1-2 mins. Stir in roasted veggies and a squeeze of lime juice until combined, 1 min Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/688816311cc5cea712806bdb/step-c8ec6020.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Once rice is done, add lime zest. Stir to combine.\n• Divide zesty rice between bowls. Top with Japanese cauliflower curry. Garnish with crispy shallots and serve with any remaining lime wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/688816311cc5cea712806bdb/step-7dc40030.jpg"
    }
  ]
